      "features": [],
      "notes": [
        "The ARC Adjustable Retractor Cannula helps surgeons see more clearly, operate with",
        "greater range of motion and minimize cannula pull-out. The proprietary locking nut",
        "and distal wing design of this cannula retracts the deltoid fascia to create a large",
        "space for better visualization. The ARC has a triple seal design, is made of silicone and",
        "is latex free. Two diameters and lengths are offered, with an optional outflow port."
      ],
      "keyParameters": []
